nation\": \"MS2500 / MV145 LLV + lit. battery\", \"supply\": \"10 – 48 V DC\", \"frequency\": null, \"internal_backup_source\": \"3.6 V DC (Li-SOCl2)\", SW...}\n\nGood. Now output. No fences.",
